<title>FRANCE: Moulinex 96/97 H1 sales rise 2.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Moulinex 96/97 H1 sales rise 2.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 3,352    vs    3,268</p>
<p>     second quarter				1,702    vs    1,703</p>
<p>NOTE - Groupe Moulinex gave its sales figures in a statement. It said turnover for the period rose 2.9 percent on a like-for-like basis from a year ago. Second quarter sales declined 0.4 percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
